# purpose: the three most common transfer rejections.
# exercises: same-account-transfer; currency-mismatch; insufficient-funds on the source;
#            a rejected transfer consumes neither a sequence number nor a transfer tag.
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob EUR
OPEN carol USD
DEPOSIT alice 50
TRANSFER alice alice 10
TRANSFER alice bob 10
TRANSFER alice carol 60
TRANSFER alice carol 50
TRANSFER alice carol 0.01
TRANSFER carol alice 25
BALANCE alice
BALANCE carol
